  "step_2": "The verbal report states: 'Lieber den sicheren Gewinn mitnehmen.' This translates to 'I prefer to take the certain gain.' This indicates the individual chose Lottery A, the certain 3000 Euros, over Lottery B. The report reflects a preference for certainty over risk, without mentioning skewness, distribution, or any consideration of the shape of the probability outcomes. There is no reference to left-skew, probability distribution, or favorable vs. unfavorable outcomes in terms of skewness. The deliberation process described is based solely on the certainty of the outcome, not on the skewness of the lotteries.",
